From 35a407ee338f02b066fa4351132a6727d8ffac5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:03:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dl-crh landing edit LE-doc: formula docstrings and proof
 sketches

Docstrings only (policy.md: each public declaration's docstring states its formula; every
nontrivial proof has a proof sketch; module docstrings carry Main definitions/Main results).
A backticked formula matching the statement is added to the first sentence of every
NO-FORMULA row of the r1 docaudit among the 68 new or changed public declarations (59 rows);
existing reference tags and proof sketches are kept. The two new DiscreteLog readers
expGenFun_eq and expSampleRaw_eq stated their equations in prose only (no backticked
relation) and get the same treatment; nothing else in DiscreteLog.lean changes.
Proof sketches: all 12 touched declarations with proofs of 15 or more lines already carry a
Proof sketch, so none is added. Module docstrings: all 7 already have Main definitions and
Main results. One pre-existing 121-column line of the FromDiscreteLog.lean module docstring
is re-wrapped (words unchanged). No statement, proof, name, attribute or import changes.
The target dlHash_crh is unchanged.

- TCSlib/Cryptography/Candidates/DiscreteLog.lean: 2
- TCSlib/Cryptography/Hashing/FromDiscreteLog.lean: 21 (+ 1 module-docstring re-wrap)
